# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.declarations-around-nested-rule {
  color: red;
  display: block;
  & { color: blue; }
  margin: 1px;
}

.declarations-around-conditional-at-rule {
  transition: opacity 1s ease;
  color: red;
  @media (min-width: 100px) {
    color: blue;
  }
  margin: 1px;
}

